[gd_resource type="Resource" script_class="Conversation" format=3]

[ext_resource type="Script" path="res://game/talk/conversation.gd" id="1_convo"]

[resource]
script = ExtResource("1_convo")
id = &"n0_hob"
text = "# DRAFT
# Hob, who keeps the Cross Keys, behind his board, night 0. He hears everything said over the ale.
# An ale ends the talk; the next talk starts at again, so he can have another.
# Plants the night-2 rule (n0_hob_jankin): he puts Jankin out at closing every night, rain or no.
== start
(A big man behind the board, a cloth over his shoulder. He looks at your habit a long while before your face.)
Hob {wary}: A brother from over the way, in the Keys. That's new.
Hob {amused}: Sit where you like. Not on Jankin.
-> topics

== again
Hob {calm}: Brother.
-> topics

== topics
* [if not n0_hob_abbey] What does the lane say about the abbey? -> abbey
* [if not n0_hob_bed] Have you a bed for the night? -> bed
* An ale, if you would. [drink] -> ale

== abbey [set n0_hob_abbey]
Hob {calm}: I pour, folk talk. I don't say any of it's true.
Hob {grave}: Pilgrims go in at that gate and don't come out. Folk say they leave by some back way. I don't know of one.
Hob {calm}: Lights in the church at night, when the brothers should be abed. And a thing on the wall with horns, Jankin says.
Hob {grave}: Jankin says a deal. But I keep my shutters barred on that side.
-> topics

== bed [set n0_hob_bed]
Hob {amused}: Beds are Agnes's business. Ask her, and don't haggle. She'll win.
Hob {grave}: We take in anyone who comes before the bell. After it the door's barred, and it stays barred.
-> bed_jankin [if not n0_hob_jankin]
-> topics

== bed_jankin [set n0_hob_jankin]
Hob {calm}: Them without a bed go out at closing. Jankin too, every night, rain or no.
-> topics

== ale
-> ale_first [if not n0_hob_poured]
-> ale_third [if drank=3]
-> ale_more

== ale_first [set n0_hob_poured]
(He draws a cup from the cask and sets it down in front of you, hard.)
Hob {warm}: A ha'penny. Or a prayer for my mother, God rest her. From you I'll take the prayer.
-> ale_jankin [if not n0_hob_jankin]
-> end

== ale_jankin [set n0_hob_jankin]
(Down the bench, Jankin's eyes are on your cup.)
Hob {amused}: Mind Jankin doesn't drink it. I put him out at closing every night, rain or no.
-> end

== ale_third
Hob {wary}: That's three, brother. Go steady. Agnes won't carry you up the stair.
(He pours it all the same.)
-> end

== ale_more
(He fills your cup again without a word.)
-> end

== leave
Hob {calm}: Bell's at nine, brother.
"
